      "writtenOn": "2023-11-17T06:36:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Frederic\n\nAfter offline discussion with Hsin-yu. I think we should remove CRAS call behavior if we enable the Bluetooth telephony feature flag.\n\nBut I will need to draft a one pager on how exactly we want to change it. So we hold on this change and I will cc you after the doc is ready.",
      "parentUuid": "4069768b_ef6a3ac5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 775,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 778,
